  - m_Id: 1678493872128
    m_Localized: Quit to main menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1989430210560
    m_Localized: 'Man... I''m gonna piss myself...

      No jumping around though!
      (space/esc - pause)

      I need to run (WASD) to the <b><u>white throne</u></b>...

      Better
      listen to the surroundings (LMB) more often - that way I will manage to find
      a way out (<b><u>look for arrows</u></b>) and avoid sticking into <b><u>something...</u></b>
      or <b><u>someone</u></b>...

      

      Wait a sec, ain''t that a fever
      dream?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426449471795200
